500                          =NUMBER OF FREQUENCIES (HARMONICS)
1.0                          =PEAK PULSE LEVEL
1.E6                         =REPETITION FREQUENCY OF PULSE TRAIN
0.5                          =DUTY CYCLE OF PULSE TRAIN
6.25E-9                      =PULSE RISE/FALL TIME
20.E-9                       =FINAL SOLUTION TIME
.1E-9                        =SOLUTION TIME INCREMENT
1.6396E-3                    =DC VALUE OF TRANSFER FUNCTION, H(0)
